{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43295","headline":"暗投明珠 · 崔藩","name":"暗投明珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至宝看怀袖，明珠出後收。\n向人光不定，离掌势难留。\n皎澈虚临夜，孤圆冷莹秋。\n乍来惊月落，疾转怕星流。\n有泪甘瑕弃，无媒自暗投。\n今朝感恩处，将欲报隋侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}